    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/ee8768db11d8ccbf2f63b6342b5fde39.webp?t=1755042183\" width=616 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/82a3577e2a4738563f1571961fb564d1.poster.avif?t=1755042183\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/82a3577e2a4738563f1571961fb564d1.webm?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/82a3577e2a4738563f1571961fb564d1.mp4?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tiny tadpoles to massive walking juggernauts, frogrammers fill a broad spectrum of offensive, defensive and supportive roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a frogrammer once and watch them battle on your side until...until you have to lay them off, of course</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/32d577fe388ed2d87c261b1ab3c05f25.webp?t=1755042183\" width=265 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/da7321fe8809ff387ab290b77ea0e0d0.poster.avif?t=1755042183\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/da7321fe8809ff387ab290b77ea0e0d0.webm?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/da7321fe8809ff387ab290b77ea0e0d0.mp4?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bugs get ever stranger and ever more numerous. Deploy your frogs strategically and manage your economy wisely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a variety of different scenarios with unique challenges and pitfalls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/0f2615dd8d82901d7c08347dce183915.webp?t=1755042183\" width=166 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/d4b18abe02e11f4278595f004658ddc3.poster.avif?t=1755042183\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/d4b18abe02e11f4278595f004658ddc3.webm?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/d4b18abe02e11f4278595f004658ddc3.mp4?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different combinations and synergies, no frogrammer can succeed alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best army composition for each scenario</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/cba340606a185d57833a4f5d9d237ed9.webp?t=1755042183\" width=327 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/9aae858e7ac8351f7b07d55fed96ca3a.poster.avif?t=1755042183\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/9aae858e7ac8351f7b07d55fed96ca3a.webm?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584240/extras/9aae858e7ac8351f7b07d55fed96ca3a.mp4?t=1755042183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's in the egg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something... is controlling the hordes...</p></li></ul>",
